# SONG ON / OFF on the pattern page (SEQ 2nd press, K1; wip211): in song mode, SONG OFF does not leave song mode, it pauses
# the advance: the current bar loops. SONG ON advances again. Song: 2 bars (patterns 1 and 2).
wait 300
key b10 down
tap SEQ
key b10 up
tap OCT+
tapkey w0
tapkey w1
tap OCT+
expect songlen 2
expect songmode 1
expect chainon 1
tap PLAY
expect songpos 1
tap SEQ
tap SEQ
expect seqpat 1
turn K1 -1
expect chainon 0
expect songon 1
expect songmode 1
wait 7000
expect songpos 1
expect playing 1
turn K1 1
expect chainon 1
wait 4500
expect songpos 2
tap PLAY
wait 300
expect songmode 1
